  "description": "Built around Brett Silva's signature aftermarket frame, the Silvawave in Gloss Dark Brick Red features a 21' top tube, stable 75° head tube angle, a longer 13.45-13.70” chainstay, and a tall 9.5” standover to give it the proper ride-feel that builds confidence at speed. Our signature Wave downtube is also featured here.\n\nAs you would expect, this bike features Brett’s Brick seat along with Sunday Street Sweeper tires, Freeze stem, Odyssey C5 Cassette hub, Quadrant rims, Twisted Pro pedals, Broc grips and more.\n\nOdyssey Springfield Brake, Lever and Quik-Slick Kable are included (not pictured).\n\nMay help with dipped t-bogs.",
